seg-7e012ab53f45 = When <c1/> runs in the same command, the HTML player lists the export files written beside it (CZML, KML, GeoJSON, STK, SigMF) as relative links to those sibling files; a link is written only for a bare file name, so none can leave the folder or reach the network. The advanced report (<c2/>) embeds the animated drawing whenever the result has a time series, whether or not <c3/> ran.

