seg-9c1d2204edab = When <c1/> runs, <c2/> gains an <c3/> block: the formats, frames per second (fps), duration, frame count, the time span, the panel titles, the JSON paths every trace was read from (<c4/>) and any series found but not drawn (<c5/>). Without <c6/> the result is byte-identical to a plain run.

