seg-fc61f546f605 = Accessibility and theme

# text
# c1: prefers-color-scheme
seg-7015f7ed77dc = <b>Colour scheme.</b> The player follows <c1/> and redraws when it changes; the animated SVG carries a light variant of its palette under the same media query. The frames use the dark palette of the static charts, because a video has no scheme.

# text
# c1: prefers-reduced-motion: reduce
seg-c3b1f19f191b = <b>Reduced motion.</b> Under <c1/> the animated SVG switches every animation off and shows the finished picture (its base styles are the end state, so nothing is hidden), and the player opens paused on the finished picture instead of playing; the user can still scrub or press Play.

